---
import { siteData } from '../data/siteData';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-slate-900/40 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-100/70 dark:bg-blue-950/80 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
        About Moazzam Shoukat
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
        A Dedicated Mentor for Your Permanent Residency & Global Career
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
        Navigating foreign immigration systems can be overwhelming. I bridge the gap by combining end-to-end case strategy with premier language coaching so your journey never hits a roadblock.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
      
      <!-- Left Narrative Bio -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
            From Qualification to Grant: One Trusted Advisor
          </h3>
          <p>
            Hello! I am <strong class="text-blue-600 dark:text-amber-400">Moazzam Shoukat</strong>. Over years of hands-on practice, I have witnessed countless eligible candidates get stuck or rejected because of two common errors: poorly prepared skills assessments and missing test cutoff scores by just a fraction of a band.
          </p>
          <p>
            That is why I structured my advisory practice as an integrated, all-in-one ecosystem. Whether you require meticulous documentation for your <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Australia Skills Assessment (ACS, VETASSESS, Engineers Australia)</strong>, high-probability filing for <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Canada Express Entry & Provincial Nominee Programs</strong>, or intensive training to conquer <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">IELTS 8+</strong>, <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">PTE 79+ Superior English</strong>, and <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white">NAATI CCL Urdu (5 PR points)</strong>, you receive specialized 1-on-1 mentorship directly from me.
          </p>
          <p>
            I operate on total transparency. Before asking you to commit to any path, we conduct an honest profile evaluation. If your profile needs additional points or work experience alignment, I map out the precise roadmap to get you eligible.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- 3 Pillars of Excellence -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-950 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-2">
              01
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1">Zero False Hopes</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Honest upfront assessment. We only proceed when the legal pathway has clear viability.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-950 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-2">
              02
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1">Proven Pedagogy</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              Exam preparation based on official rubrics and machine-scoring algorithms (IELTS & PTE).
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200/70 dark:border-slate-800">
            <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-2">
              03
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1">Direct Support</h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
              You communicate directly with me, ensuring no delegation to untrained junior staff.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right Focus Areas Card -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
        <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 shadow-xl space-y-5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800 pb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
            Core Areas of Mastery
          </h3>

          <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/80 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
                <Icon name="globe" class="w-5 h-5" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-semibold">Immigration Consulting (Canada & Australia)</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs">Express Entry, PNPs, GSM Subclass 189/190/491, EOI management.</span>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/80 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
                <Icon name="academic" class="w-5 h-5" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-semibold">Student Visa Guidance</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs">University admissions, genuine student compliance, SOP drafting, and visa lodgement.</span>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/80 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400">
                <Icon name="certificate" class="w-5 h-5" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-semibold">Australia Skills Assessment</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs">ACS, VETASSESS, Engineers Australia (CDR), TRA documentation & compliance.</span>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">
                <Icon name="language" class="w-5 h-5" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-semibold">English Test Training (IELTS, PTE, TOEFL, Duolingo)</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs">Targeted band 8+ / 79+ templates, speaking fluency mock drills, writing rubrics.</span>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-950/80 text-rose-600 dark:text-rose-400">
                <Icon name="translate" class="w-5 h-5" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white block font-semibold">NAATI CCL Urdu Trainer</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-xs">Specialized Urdu-to-English dialogue training to unlock 5 bonus PR points.</span>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
            <a
              href="#contact"
              class="block w-full text-center py-3 px-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm bg-slate-900 text-white dark:bg-white dark:text-slate-900 hover:bg-blue-600 dark:hover:bg-amber-400 transition-colors"
            >
              Request Profile Evaluation
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
